171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 73 0 R
/T (Since 2023, over 11,000 individuals in Rwanda, who would otherwise have no access to rehabilitation, have received support through the Inclusion App with only 70 CHWs from five health centres selected during the initial pilot phase to test feasibility while delivering future solution today. CHWs have been trained to share tailored, safe exercises for musculoskeletal conditions, with 90% of users reporting meaningful recovery without needing further referral. Moreover, Digital health in service delivery especially using Inclusion App have proven to be 7 times more cost-effective than traditional rehabilitation services and also the Inclusion App pathway achieved significantly higher quality of life impact, with 1.38 QALYs gained per user, compared to the physiotherapy pathway with 0.47 QALYs)
/E (Since 2023, over 11,000 individuals in Rwanda, who would otherwise have no access to rehabilitation, have received support through the Inclusion App with only 70 CHWs from five health centres selected during the initial pilot phase to test feasibility while delivering future solution today. CHWs have been trained to share tailored, safe exercises for musculoskeletal conditions, with 90% of users reporting meaningful recovery without needing further referral. Moreover, Digital health in service delivery especially using Inclusion App have proven to be 7 times more cost-effective than traditional rehabilitation services and also the Inclusion App pathway achieved significantly higher quality of life impact, with 1.38 QALYs gained per user, compared to the physiotherapy pathway with 0.47 QALYs)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
