790 0 obj
<<
/Title (This concept seeks funding to scale the Inclusion App across 14 additional districts, training 930 CHWs through a two-day orientation, distributing pre-installed smartphones, and providing ongoing monthly field supervision and refresher training. The intervention will enable the delivery of over 244,000 personalized exercise programs annually, transforming access to care for thousands of people living in remote areas.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 501 0 R
/Prev 881 0 R
/Next 684 0 R
>>
endobj
791 0 obj
<<
/Title (Over 2.4 billion people worldwide currently need rehabilitation services. In Rwanda, the need is growing rapidly, driven by the increasing burden of non-communicable diseases \(NCDs\), aging and chronic conditions. Despite this, fewer than 500 Physiotherapists are tasked with serving a population of over 14 million. This imbalance is even more pronounced at the community level, where over 90% of Rwandans access care through primary healthcare facilities, yet rehabilitation professionals are only available at secondary and tertiary levels, and in limited numbers.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 685 0 R
/Next 882 0 R
>>
